BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_824d5acc-22ef-38a9-973d-3c0d63dbce6f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
